<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>The vector between two points</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>On a town map (1 unit = 1 km) the bus park is at \(A({@a1@},\,{@a2@})\) and the hospital at \(B({@b1@},\,{@b2@})\).</p><p>(a) Write \(\overrightarrow{AB}\) as a column vector.</p><div>\(\overrightarrow{AB} =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) The market M is at the end of the vector \({@col(vv)@}\) drawn from the school \(C({@c1@},\,{@c2@})\), so \(\overrightarrow{CM} = {@col(vv)@}\). Find the coordinates of M.</p><div>M = ( [[input:ans2]] , [[input:ans3]] ) [[validation:ans2]] [[validation:ans3]]</div><div>[[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) \(\overrightarrow{AB}\) is end minus start: B's coordinates minus A's. Across: \([[if test="is(a1<0)"]]{@b1@} - ({@a1@})[[else]]{@b1@} - {@a1@}[[/if]] = {@b1-a1@}\); up: \([[if test="is(a2<0)"]]{@b2@} - ({@a2@})[[else]]{@b2@} - {@a2@}[[/if]] = {@b2-a2@}\). So \(\overrightarrow{AB} = {@tAB@}\).</p><p>(b) Start at C and make the moves of the vector: M = \(([[if test="is(v1<0)"]]{@c1@} + ({@v1@})[[else]]{@c1@} + {@v1@}[[/if]],\ [[if test="is(v2<0)"]]{@c2@} + ({@v2@})[[else]]{@c2@} + {@v2@}[[/if]])\) \(= ({@m1@},\,{@m2@})\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[validate_numeric(ex) := block([sx], sx: ev(ex, simp), if listofvars(ex) = [] and freeof(%i, sx) then "" else "Type a number in each box, not a letter.");
col(v) := matrix([v[1]],[v[2]]);
/* Design: the vector between two points, town-map context, with the reverse step (a point from a vector). Source: adapted from SMP AS/A2 Core 4, Chapter 9, Section B, B5(a). */
a1: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0]); a2: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0]);
b1: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0,a1]); b2: rand(11)-5;

b2: if [a1,a2,b1,b2]=[3,-1,5,4] then 3 elseif [a1,a2,b1,b2]=[-2,-5,1,-3] then -2 else b2;
v1: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0]); v2: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0]);
c1: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0]); c2: rand_with_prohib(-5,5,[0,2*v2]);
vv: [v1,v2];
tAB: col([b1-a1,b2-a2]); rev: col([a1-b1,a2-b2]); plus: col([a1+b1,a2+b2]);
m: [c1+v1, c2+v2]; mrev: [c1-v1, c2-v2];
m1: m[1]; m2: m[2];
tw1: tAB+matrix([1],[0]); badm: matrix([q],[1]);
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
